# Environment Variables Template for FutureCapsule

## Development (.env.local)

Copy this template to the workspace root as `.env.local` and fill in your Supabase credentials.

```env
# ============================================
# Supabase Configuration (Development/Local)
# ============================================
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API

# Supabase Project URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co

# Supabase Anon Key (public - safe for frontend)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...

# Supabase Service Role Key (private - for server-side only)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...

# Environment
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENVIRONMENT=development
```

# Google Analytics measurement ID (optional)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXX

# ============================================
# Environment Settings (Development)
# ============================================

# Environment name for conditional logic
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENVIRONMENT=development

# Use local Firebase emulator (for offline development)
NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_EMULATOR=true

# Firestore database ID (optional, for multiple databases)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIRESTORE_DATABASE_ID=default

# ============================================
# Backend/API Settings (Local Development)
# ============================================

# API base URL (default: http://localhost:3000)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Enable debug logging
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEBUG=true

# Session timeout (milliseconds, default 1 hour)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SESSION_TIMEOUT=3600000
```

---

## Staging (Vercel Environment Variables)

Add these to your Vercel project under Settings → Environment Variables.

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyD...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=futurecapsule-staging.firebaseapp.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=futurecapsule-staging
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=futurecapsule-staging.appspot.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=234567890
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:234567890:web:def456ghi789
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-YYYYYY

NEXT_PUBLIC_ENVIRONMENT=staging
NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_EMULATOR=false
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://staging.futurecapsule.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEBUG=false
NEXT_PUBLIC_SESSION_TIMEOUT=3600000
```

