## Database-Specific Settings (Optional)

### Multi-Database Setup

If using multiple Firestore databases:

```env
# Primary database (default)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIRESTORE_DATABASE_ID=(default)

# Backup database
FIRESTORE_BACKUP_DATABASE_ID=backup-db
```

