## Email Configuration (Optional)

For Firebase Auth email verification:

```env
# Email provider (optional, uses Firebase defaults if not set)
FIREBASE_EMAIL_PROVIDER=sendgrid
SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.xxx...

# Or use Mailgun
FIREBASE_EMAIL_PROVIDER=mailgun
MAILGUN_API_KEY=key-xxx...
MAILGUN_DOMAIN=mg.futurecapsule.com
```

